[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7805.669, "timestamp": "02:10:05", "text": "你的東西都帶齊了嗎？  例如包裝之類的東西？我有包裝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7808.229, "timestamp": "02:10:08", "text": "系統。他媽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7817.589, "timestamp": "02:10:17", "text": "啊，我把那玩意兒搞砸了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7819.99, "timestamp": "02:10:19", "text": "等等，房車……快離開這裡。  等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7825.109, "timestamp": "02:10:25", "text": "，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7826.95, "timestamp": "02:10:26", "text": "走吧。那聲音怎麼樣？  歡迎前來調查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7846.43, "timestamp": "02:10:46", "text": "。你好"}]